<title>UK: BOE sets 127.60 rate on gilt conversion.</title>
<headline>BOE sets 127.60 rate on gilt conversion.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said holders of 13-1/2 percent 2004-2008 Treasury stock can convert their holdings into 8-1/2 percent 2005 Treasury stock at a rate of 127.60 stg.</p>
<p>The conversion date is September 26.</p>
</text>
